text 10 "  Done. The README has an install section and a usage example."
style 10 0 120 fg=#dedede bg=#131313
text 11 "   /new                   start a new conversation (/resume goes back to the old one). /new continue starts it from a"
style 11 0 120 fg=#f2f9ff bg=#006ee5
text 12 "   /resume                go back to an earlier conversation of this session, from a list or by its number"
style 12 0 3 fg=#dedede bg=#101010
style 12 3 24 fg=#dedede bg=#101010 bold
style 12 24 120 fg=#dedede bg=#101010
text 13 "   /cost                  what this session has cost"
style 13 0 3 fg=#dedede bg=#101010
style 13 3 24 fg=#dedede bg=#101010 bold
style 13 24 120 fg=#dedede bg=#101010
text 14 "   /workers               what each worker is doing, or reported"
style 14 0 3 fg=#dedede bg=#101010
style 14 3 24 fg=#dedede bg=#101010 bold
style 14 24 120 fg=#dedede bg=#101010
text 15 "   /stop-workers          stop the workers running, or one of them (the agent can resume them)"
style 15 0 3 fg=#dedede bg=#101010
style 15 3 24 fg=#dedede bg=#101010 bold
style 15 24 120 fg=#dedede bg=#101010
text 16 "   /watch                 follow one worker's own work, or the main agent's again"
style 16 0 3 fg=#dedede bg=#101010
style 16 3 24 fg=#dedede bg=#101010 bold
style 16 24 120 fg=#dedede bg=#101010
text 17 "   /message               send a worker a message directly, which it reads at its next step or goes on with if it"
style 17 0 3 fg=#dedede bg=#101010
style 17 3 24 fg=#dedede bg=#101010 bold
style 17 24 120 fg=#dedede bg=#101010
text 18 "   /view                  how much of the work the transcript shows"
